{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03235","headline":"使至嵩山寻杜四不遇慨然复伤田洗马韩观主因以题壁赠杜侯杜四 · 宋之问","name":"使至嵩山寻杜四不遇慨然复伤田洗马韩观主因以题壁赠杜侯杜四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛桥瞻太室，期子在云烟。\n归来不相见，孤赏弄寒泉。\n与君阔松石，于兹二十年。\n田公谢昭世，韩子秘幽埏。\n忆昔同携手，山栖接二贤。\n笙歌入玄地，诗酒坐寥天。\n旧友悉零落，罢琴私自怜。\n逝者非药误，餐霞意可全。\n爲余理还策，相与事灵仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03235.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03235","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}